Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 card packs shop fills 16:9

The card packs shop (STCRDSHP) ran with gutter 0. Its scrolling background
repeats every 96 pixels, so with a widescreen gutter it is drawn twice more,
96 pixels to each side (as patch 0053), and port/options/widescreen.c gives
the overlay the menu gutter. Off, nothing changes.

